WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,420
Oh my God! Then you don’t eat people?

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,760
Haven't eaten it yet

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:09,980
Great! It scared me to death during the day

4
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,780
I just said how can you drive if you lose money?

5
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,580
By the way, thank you so much for the food

6
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,380
I've been eating cookies for three days

7
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,180
I'm going to starve to death if I don't eat anymore.

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,220
What is your superpower?

9
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,680
I have no powers

10
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:26,020
His brain shouldn't be able to make such a judgment

11
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,220
His expression doesn’t look like he’s pretending either.

12
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,420
He really doesn't know

13
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,000
Everyone has it

14
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,960
You haven’t discovered your superpower yet.

15
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,560
My superpowers only came about after I lost them.

16
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,980
I have all these strange powers.

17
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:45,600
Other strange abilities should also exist

18
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,280
It turned out to be black Ji Chuan

19
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,480
Your name is Ji Chuan

20
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:56,940
Actually, I saw you in the community. Well, you go to sleep.

21
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:57,940
I don't have to sleep

22
00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:59,140
I can help you keep vigil
